  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "53",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 53"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "53",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who hath believed our report? and to whom is the arm of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "revealed?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he shall grow up before him as a tender plant, and as a root out of a dry ground: he hath no form nor comeliness; and when we shall see him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no beauty that we should desire him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is despised and rejected of men; a man of sorrows, and acquainted with grief: and we hid as it were",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "our",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "faces from him; he was despised, and we esteemed him not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Surely he hath borne our griefs, and carried our sorrows: yet we did esteem him stricken, smitten of God, and afflicted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wounded for our transgressions,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bruised for our iniquities: the chastisement of our peace",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon him; and with his stripes we are healed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All we like sheep have gone astray; we have turned every one to his own way; and the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath laid on him the iniquity of us all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was oppressed, and he was afflicted, yet he opened not his mouth: he is brought as a lamb to the slaughter, and as a sheep before her shearers is dumb, so he openeth not his mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was taken from prison and from judgment: and who shall declare his generation? for he was cut off out of the land of the living: for the transgression of my people was he stricken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he made his grave with the wicked, and with the rich in his death; because he had done no violence, neither",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deceit in his mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Yet it pleased the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to bruise him; he hath put",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to grief: when thou shalt make his soul an offering for sin, he shall see",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "seed, he shall prolong",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "days, and the pleasure of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall prosper in his hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall see of the travail of his soul,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be satisfied: by his knowledge shall my righteous servant justify many; for he shall bear their iniquities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore will I divide him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "a portion",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.53.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.53.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with the great, and he shall divide the spoil with the strong; because he hath poured out his soul unto death: and he was numbered with the transgressors; and he bare the sin of many, and made intercession for the transgressors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
